{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9344.71499,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9748.43655,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9803.623733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9805.841065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9807.240809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9808.034562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9809.803061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9811.420462,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":21370.971416,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21850.156307,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21902.390691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21903.837957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21905.570952000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21907.480592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21909.257863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21911.016547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21911.929499,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":34269.182903,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34597.751339,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34648.489094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34650.120526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34651.743606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":34653.391523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34655.147352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":34656.5558,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":45147.486774,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45642.742902,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45699.116418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45700.695651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45702.37786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45704.095211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45705.980735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45707.704977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45709.485554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45711.31949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45713.127798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45713.286397,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52171.61277,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52443.573518,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":52487.890362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52489.327962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52491.128629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52492.913782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52494.117061,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":62535.665442,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62810.55356,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62856.232461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62857.764003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62859.534064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62859.75122,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62901.556669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62903.681212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62905.01722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62905.224322,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75564.986781,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":76004.36,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":76053.612022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76055.177405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76056.820424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76058.522152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76060.288688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76061.793019,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":77713.747588,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77916.122281,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77959.466592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77961.562272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77962.81189,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":90768.685282,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91015.119031,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":91058.042039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91059.670336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91061.388128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":91061.532565,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":91096.486135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91098.168994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":91098.341083,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101147.061824,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101483.348943,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101530.07631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101531.798979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101533.505594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101535.370137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":101535.526151,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101571.994297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101573.855244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101575.459226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101576.701833,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":107837.396323,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108094.760351,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":108140.234223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108141.760197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":108143.502225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108145.292176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":108145.412437,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116382.220493,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116745.349598,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116793.720055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116795.304366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116796.961337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116798.807893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116800.599876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116800.87556,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127111.754426,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127502.972623,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127553.572049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127555.167798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127556.930938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127558.645135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127560.396047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127562.248191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127564.139844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127564.259334,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138049.918122,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138400.025114,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138445.75437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138447.928388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138448.458074,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138491.148212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138492.79648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138494.534482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138496.295459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138497.464837,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138527.127253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138527.685592,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":151206.988904,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151655.536793,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151713.481811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151714.85836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151716.509082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151718.269428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":151720.059909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151721.83703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151723.609184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":151725.29607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":151727.116866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":151727.288294,"samples":11088,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159380.192256,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159653.423484,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159701.802032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159703.266924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159704.898487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159706.746154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159707.897655,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167812.699013,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168156.176686,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":168206.41547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168208.085801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168209.558024,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":168242.521051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168243.943209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168245.653249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":168246.158599,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":179467.333193,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179855.788032,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179911.55833,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179912.971064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179914.696497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179916.497645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179918.215076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179919.995573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179921.853775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179922.284914,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":189600.550653,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189912.580456,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":189961.938647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189963.316117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":189965.027961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189966.716549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189968.366128,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":200010.432929,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200410.417838,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200459.96317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200461.45304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200463.085574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200464.930767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200465.833414,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200496.55389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200497.051488,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":212909.461335,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":213224.840874,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":213274.095429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":213275.6799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213277.304803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213279.032359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213280.864253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213282.427883,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"close","t":224503.814336,"code":1005}]}